privacy.description:
The bot works with slash commands and buttons: it **does not read** message text. It only receives the event of a message (author, channel, date, Guild Messages intent) to count XP and spawn chests.

**Moderation, per server:**
• warnings and sanction history: member, moderator, reason, duration, date (2 years max); ongoing temporary bans and quarantines;
• giveaways (30 days after the end), scheduled announcements (until sent);
• ticket tracking: author, staff, dates, rating (90 days after deletion; never the content);
• the server settings.

**Games, per server (currency with no real value):**
• wallet and its history, XP and level, job, inventory, achievements, statistics, profile (bio, theme), reputation, birthday (day and month): erased after **1 year without activity**;
• quests, daily games and finished games: **30 days**; the state of an ongoing game is never exported;
• daily counters and limits, anti-farming traces: **2 days** (8 for a week).

**Retention:** as long as the bot is on the server (except the periods above). If it is removed, everything is erased **30 days** later. Daily backups are replaced after 7 days.
**Your data:** `/privacy moi:Export my data` sends you a JSON file; `/privacy moi:Erase my data` erases or anonymises it. Kept: sanctions you received (2 years) and an **anti-abuse footprint** with no content (account freeze, last daily date, achievements earned, level reached, quests and daily games of today and yesterday, daily limits), 1 year at most, so that erasing cannot be used to replay rewards. A wallet frozen by the staff is only erased once unfrozen.
**Immediate erasure:** an administrator can use `/privacy supprimer:True`.

